                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e5ceebc0-1966-45a0-b33a-c3492d711990" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b361b27d-e4ec-432a-b8d2-bbf6c6fb4e3e">
                  <nc xml:id="m-8819eacf-21f9-4d72-8702-c155b05a1a40" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-9b86ed7f-b43a-4246-88b6-0d66bb5eb963">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-0721d1ea-97eb-45f6-b2a4-a93626e0e74d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-6e40ccd1-e631-4dce-bc96-d7363cba3f8e">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ad71d80d-96ea-4f07-b707-e83295197ec0" pname="c" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d9fcf708-f995-43d7-a612-1b4a5b008cb9"><syl /><neume facs="#m-6fdc68eb-0c0d-46b3-8e0b-ccf1837b85de" type="cavum" xml:id="m-c01814cb-a684-46bb-bb97-ecafa9ff5797"><nc xml:id="m-988e4e25-b575-4014-b9b5-db187d70d1b6" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-bf4784f1-d75c-47fc-88c2-08be0621fcb8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-cb399955-cf32-40d3-8a11-3a850575a838" type="punctum" xml:id="m-90ef3ec2-f4ab-44f2-8d02-cff9072a1d85">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1eb2638f-8eee-4d44-8c02-272f7215a084" pname="d" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-78789e44-d67a-4cb8-9560-a2e3245ee170" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-0b22e435-dc4a-4256-ac6f-12cc42e53111" facs="#m-41237738-253e-4749-a3be-082d2ca0944e" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d6dea41d-ad38-446e-8322-55ee0ebf6650"><lg xml:id="m-80cc48bf-3ece-43fa-84f8-ee0fd57082c5"><l xml:id="m-f464e37a-3a1a-47b5-8697-7a427bdfaeb9" facs="#m-47bb1f19-8eab-4020-8eca-8e439171bc9a" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-9dafadb4-72ed-4279-90e0-63141afe40a1" facs="#m-61689e35-4074-4ce0-be77-4ee5d3e35165" label="ambiguous">Appendix</l><l xml:id="m-982a647b-07b8-4ea3-9ce4-fee3709aca54" facs="#m-1bd32ef5-ad7d-49c3-a57e-0844afa38e17" label="ambiguous">TRACT INA PSALM-TONE</l><l xml:id="m-db82bf2a-fa59-4988-ac83-0acfa4a79bbf" facs="#m-417c4afd-c0ce-4cfc-b9b3-433abceed485" label="text-like">First Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-84aeb8c2-acd2-4d24-a18a-bc316e881d4f" facs="#m-446edd7a-1f0f-49d7-8535-ad7ff8ea98de" label="ambiguous">Tract</l><l xml:id="m-45c1bc9e-cd35-4dd7-a009-9d9d66c4abef" facs="#m-e4b772d0-2adc-4c54-b5bc-06786f910ad5" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-374f014a-d0f2-4f88-9465-8388ab27c333" facs="#m-da2c937f-28f3-4722-be78-407042ace823" label="lyrics-like">Ul hábi-tat“ in adju-tó-ri-o Altissimi,</l><l xml:id="m-bff5d686-127c-4296-9ace-21d46c2664f0" facs="#m-93ebc168-8236-4c0c-bfbf-60fd4a090eb7" label="ambiguous">in pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fe0ab4b-b36f-4997-9644-bb634b272654" facs="#m-15f46ec3-fedd-4e5f-82b0-f5f59701a0c8" label="lyrics-like">tecti-óne Dé-i caéli commorábi-tur. V. 2. Di-cet Dómino:</l><l xml:id="m-346d5527-f498-4c13-8f0d-73c482519650" facs="#m-966eed4b-b648-462f-b685-4d815bce1313" label="lyrics-like">Suscéptor mé-us es, f et re-fúgi-um mé¬ um : "Dé-us</l><l xml:id="m-67dd3fd0-a5b0-4db4-bf0d-ea74936d4be9" facs="#m-e315c8b7-82c7-4797-90fb-0459c8a063f5" label="lyrics-like">mé-us, sperábo in é¬ um.</l><l xml:id="m-ad22c00a-6a40-406c-b97a-fef6563d9705" facs="#m-9fbfd947-1f47-42ff-a8c1-7affeff16ae0" label="lyrics-like">V. 3. Quóniam ipse liberávit me de láqueo venántium,</l><l xml:id="m-c6fb35a7-1691-42ed-8f24-aa77a24f4a38" facs="#m-6875c4fd-976d-4f7f-9016-47031f8c435c" label="lyrics-like">et a vérbo áspero.</l><l xml:id="m-6a8733bc-4ade-4246-a7de-45bd057b9908" facs="#m-21e14722-87d5-47f5-adf8-87c20189524d" label="lyrics-like">V. A. Scápulis súis obumbrábit tíbi, * et sub pénnis éjus</l><l xml:id="m-9c3371b8-6410-4440-b18e-e597fce818f2" facs="#m-ed3f4344-b866-46f9-aef2-f5173a8cf938" label="lyrics-like">sperábis.</l><l xml:id="m-5e5afc3c-b2c3-49f6-85b6-67a452832f90" facs="#m-9ea2a002-38ae-4cf5-a888-015d3f2dead3" label="lyrics-like">V. 5. Scúto circúmdabit te véritas éjus: “ non timébis a</l><l xml:id="m-36d5179e-c44d-4904-be2a-3b141cb7e6b3" facs="#m-94e47e4c-9c16-41c1-9bf6-88847897affb" label="lyrics-like">timóre noctúrno.</l><l xml:id="m-11a3cb5f-33e8-49ca-ac6e-5cdd0495759b" facs="#m-d1cfa379-f782-4855-a913-86915c539390" label="lyrics-like">V. 6.A sagítta volánte per díem, f a negótio perambulánte</l><l xml:id="m-57aa1f33-cc18-4e77-a926-bda493d1cb45" facs="#m-8c14ddec-0f31-4512-9042-9d6c97954918" label="lyrics-like">in ténebris, * a ruína et daemónio meridiáno.</l><l xml:id="m-ab3d5f87-b6a9-4420-8332-55d48868da8c" facs="#m-d86aa200-39f8-4e7a-b25a-e4761e85e902" label="lyrics-like">V. 7. Cádent a látere túo mille, t et décem millia a déxtris</l><l xml:id="m-b272913d-e7be-4f86-8097-1507302ab2d0" facs="#m-ce712ad6-c9f7-4b0b-b57f-d125d45ff648" label="lyrics-like">túis: * tíbi autem non appropinquábit.</l><l xml:id="m-96c86084-fd6e-4105-9437-07075a2408cd" facs="#m-3b32f45d-aef5-476d-8a5e-50cde5a48417" label="lyrics-like">N. 8. Quóniam Angélis súis mandávit de te, “ ut custódiant</l><l xml:id="m-ff8c9c60-b5f1-4358-8136-0a1bb51f1d98" facs="#m-699289ef-65b9-4d26-9fc3-378bce00e2ca" label="lyrics-like">te in ómnibus viis túis.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>